[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:09.76]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:14.60]left a single note and went on their way
[00:20.00]I never got their name until the credits
[00:24.00]now it plays here every single day
[00:28.78]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:30.64]One note at a time
[00:34.00]from people passing through
[00:38.72]a name beside a line
[00:43.10]and part of it is you
[00:49.50]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
